# Read by stow when run from the repo root.
# starship has no include, so work-pc ships a full starship.toml (Latte palette) that replaces dev's (Mocha).
# Let a later package override it: list the machine package last (stow -R core dev work-pc).
--override=\.config/starship/starship\.toml
# same for fish: work-pc ships its own Latte features (theme, fzf, bat-theme) replacing dev's (Mocha).
--override=\.config/fish/features/(00-theme|fzf|bat-theme)\.fish
# Always link per file, never a whole folder: tools (and local zellij layouts) can then add
# files next to the links without them landing in the repo.
--no-folding
